'''True Form''', '''Third Form''', or '''Awakened Form''' for [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cats]], is the third form of many [[Cat Units]]. When evolving into a True Form, a cat can have an improvement in stats and possibly changes in abilities. After beating [[Into the Future]], [[Talents]] become available for certain True Form Cats. As of [[Version 13.0 Update|Version 13.0]], certain level 60 True Form [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cats]] can further evolve into their [[Ultra Form]]s using [[Catfruit|Catfruit/Behemoth Stones]] and XP.

Currently, only about 1/3 of the units in the game have this additional form.

